direction: right
claude: Claude picks a tool
pre: PreToolUse hook
tool: Tool runs
post: PostToolUse hook
result: Result back to Claude
block: Blocked, stderr to Claude
claude -> pre: tool_name + tool_input
pre -> tool: exit 0
pre -> block: exit 2
block -> claude: reason
tool -> post: file_path
post -> result: formatted
result -> claude
